WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.779 --> 00:00:05.839
The COO is the role of someone who
needs to be a jack of many trades,

00:00:05.839 --> 00:00:08.056
and a master of many trades.

00:00:08.056 --> 00:00:09.414
That's a complex role,

00:00:09.414 --> 00:00:12.913
it's someone who can thrive
under operational in excellence.

00:00:12.913 --> 00:00:16.959
But also be able to understand trends,
create systems,

00:00:16.959 --> 00:00:20.431
put the research together
to drive innovation.

00:00:20.431 --> 00:00:23.276
The emerging COO driving innovation and

00:00:23.276 --> 00:00:28.301
operational excellence It's a program for
current or aspiring COOs.

00:00:28.301 --> 00:00:33.494
It's a program that provides COOs with
framework to help them become more

00:00:33.494 --> 00:00:38.617
effective and successful in this
complicated and multifaceted route.

